 "about": "Product Dashboard (dashboard.html) query list. Each query runs once over the last 90 complete UTC days: replace \"<START>\" with the first day's 00:00:00 UTC and \"<END>\" with yesterday 23:59:59 UTC as epoch seconds (numbers, not strings). 'chart' goes to query_amplitude_data's chart param, 'definition' to its definition param; always pass projectId 773708, groupByLimit as given and timeSeriesLimit equal to it. Save each raw tool result as <raw-dir>/<id>.json, then run node scripts/build-dashboard.mjs <raw-dir>. Page shows only the paid segment; the all/free segments stay in the queries so every response is large enough to be saved to a file.",
